---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Arena"
  description="Playable artifacts from the Live axis — each build embedded next to its score. Coming soon."
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Arena</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Playable artifacts from the Live axis land here — each build embedded next to its score.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="stub">
    <h2>Under construction — honestly</h2>
    <p>
      The Live axis already runtime-verifies one-shot builds in a real browser
      (see <a href="/gauntlet#axis-l">methodology</a>). The Arena is where those
      artifacts become playable: the thing the model built, embedded on the page,
      right next to the score it earned. You judge it with your own hands.
    </p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;">
      Nothing to play yet. When there is, it will be here — not before.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
